# lib/ui: the glass components every app of novOS shares.
#
# An app's build merges these files into the app's own module folder, so that both
# import as one directory: QML, JS, icons/, i18n/ (per-language files merged by
# namespace) and qmldir (the app's lines first). A name both have stops the build.
# The app ships UiConfig.js there, and puts the fonts novos-inter-*.ttf one level
# up. Merging is done by lib/ui/stage.py.
singleton GlassStyle GlassStyle.qml
singleton I18n I18n.qml
singleton Remote Remote.qml
singleton PerfProbe PerfProbe.qml
